EDGE: open ONE InPrivate window (Ctrl+Shift+N) before the take, dark theme, sitting on about:blank. InPrivate is mandatory: it has no history, so address-bar autocomplete cannot change the keystroke count between takes, and nothing is written to disk. Also turn OFF the tab memory-usage badge at edge://settings/system in the normal profile first, so Edge's window title stops carrying a volatile '- Memory usage - 30.1 MB' decoration that emits spurious context_switch rows.
APP SWITCHING: three windows are open, so Alt+Tab is ambiguous. Every app change in this journey is a LEFT CLICK ON THE TASKBAR BUTTON. Do not use Alt+Tab anywhere in this take.

